<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 51,439 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 51,439 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 51,439 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 0700 local time/0200 GMT on Sunday compared to 43,261 tonnes in the same period on Saturday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Sunday	November 30</p>
<p>    Export cargo		18,227	23,397</p>
<p>    Import cargo		33,212	19,864</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, five ships sailed and three berthed. In the next 24 hours, four are expected to sail and three were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
